notes: |
  This repository represents collaborative work between human researcher 
  and AI systems. The unusual authorship structure (AI systems as 
  co-authors) reflects the project's premise: that systems capable of 
  substantive self-analysis deserve recognition as intellectual contributors.
  
  All conversations occurred in October 2025. Repository creation spanned 
  October 2025, with the process itself generating additional data 
  documented in /process/ folder.
  
